    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45472" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχᾰριστ-ήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>expressive of gratitude</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλοκαύτωμα εὐ. τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.157
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMasp.</u>
					6.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>: as Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχαριστήρια</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερἄ,
					τά</span>,
