			</span></i>, cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				7.9
			</span></i>; <i>mission of thanks</i> to the Senate, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				29.11
			</span></i>: sg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀσκληπιῷ καὶ Υγεία . .
				εὐχαριστήριον</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέθηκεν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).1086
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Melos</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.132l
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.162.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				699
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Egypt</span>), <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ma.</u>
				12.45
			</span></i>.</div>
